    These images are used in the documentation of `winit`.
    
    ## `coordinate-systems*`
    
    These files are created by [Mads Marquart](https://github.com/madsmtm) using
    [draw.io](https://draw.io/), and compressed using [svgomg.net](https://svgomg.net/).
    
